  "title": "Babur",
  "summary": "Babur (1483–1530) was the founder of the Mughal dynasty. He took Kabul in 1504, then moved east and in 1526 took Delhi from the Lodi sultans. He wrote a memoir, the Baburnama, in Chagatai Turkish, and died in Agra in 1530; his body was later moved to a garden in Kabul.",
